<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Clayton Homes raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Clayton Homes raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst Ivy Schneider upgraded Clayton Homes Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- in summary report cited a rebound in Clayton's operations, attractive valuation and &quot;impeccable track record.&quot;</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 9/16 to 15-1/16.</p>
</text>
